in statement boolean {ifBody 1 2 3 4} {elseBody 1}

,                                                               input
>,                                                              set statement
[<->-]<                                                         set input to moins statement
[                                                               enter if false
[-]>>-<<                                                        set in to 0 and boolean minus 1 to set it to false
==================================else body===========================================
>>>>>>>
++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++.
<<<<<<<
==================================/else body\==========================================
]
>>+                                                             goto boolean : 0 if false (because minus in loop) 1 if true
[                                                               enter if true (1)
==================================if body===========================================
>
++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++.
>++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++.
>++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ +++++++.
>++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ ++++++++++ +.
<<<<-                                                            go back to boolean and minus to set to 0
==================================/if body\===========================================
]